==Results==
Brazauskas received a majority of the vote everywhere except [[Kaunas]], and did particularly well in areas inhabited by the Russian and Polish minorities.<ref name=vardys/> This allowed him to win the presidency in a single round; his 61 percent vote share exceeded the 50 percent threshold required to avoid a runoff.

